      "text": "An artistic game designer who thinks in mechanics, and designs **gameplay **for the **experience **as a whole.\n\nI’m interested in the ideas, systems, and visual details that make a game unmistakably its own.\n\nFrom designing procedural worlds to shaping the moment-to-moment player experience, I enjoy bringing different parts of game design together to create something cohesive, expressive, and memorable.\n\nRefining how a game looks, feels, and communicates with the player.",
